<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP GROUP SEVEN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP GROUP SEVEN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from Saturday's two</p>
<p>African Nations Cup group seven qualifying matches:</p>
<p>In Lusaka: Zambia 1 Mauritius 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Vincent Mutale 40</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>In Maputo: Mozambique 2 Malawi 1 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Mozambique - Pinto Barros 85, Tico Tico 87</p>
<p>Malawi - Manson Shabba Phiri 62</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
<p>    Final standings  P  W  D  L  F  A   Pts</p>
<p> Zambia		  6  4  2  0 11   5   14</p>
<p> Mozambique	    6  3  1  2 12   9   10</p>
<p> Malawi		  6  3  0  3 12  12    9</p>
<p> Mauritius	     6  0  1  5  6  15    1</p>
<p>Zambia and Mozambique qualify for 1998 finals in Burkina</p>
<p>Faso.</p>
</text>
